-slideshow-cycle-main-frame-row views_slideshow_cycle_slide views_slideshow_slide views-row-2 views_slideshow_cycle_hidden views-row-even\">\n  <div class=\"views-slideshow-cycle-main-frame-row-item views-row views-row-0 views-row-first views-row-odd\">\n    \n          <div class=\"imagem_noticia\"><a href=\"/noticias648\"><img typeof=\"foaf:Image\" src=\"http://www.ita.br/sites/default/files/styles/noticia_principal/public/pictures/noticias/ITA-SJC%20%282%29_1.jpg?itok=Fu8T3_8T\" width=\"700\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>    \n          <h1 class=\"titulo_noticia\"><a href=\"/noticias648\">ITA adequa comunicação institucional ao período de defeso eleitoral</a></h1>    \n          <h2 class=\"chamada_noticia\">Iniciativa é fundamentada na legislação eleitoral vigente</h2>    \n          <div class=\"controls-pager\"><img typeof=\"foaf:Image\" src=\"http://www.ita.br/sites/default/files/styles/noticias_controls/public/pictures/noticias/ITA-SJC%20%282%29_1.jpg?itok=62UF1MMd\" width=\"139\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" /></div>  </div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"views_slideshow_cycle_div_noticias-noticia_2\" class=\"views-slideshow-cycle-main-frame-row views_slideshow_cycle_slide views_slideshow_slide views-row-3 views_slideshow_cycle_hidden views-row-odd\">\n  <div class=\"views-slideshow-cycle-main-frame-row-item views-row views-row-0 views-row-first views-row-odd\">\n    \n          <div class=\"imagem_noticia\"><a href=\"/noticias647\"><img typeof=\"foaf:Image\" src=\"http://www.ita.br/sites/default/files/styles/noticia_principal/public/pictures/noticias/ITA-SJC%20%282%29_0.jpg?itok=415fWwIo\" width=\"700\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>    \n          <h1 class=\"titulo_noticia\"><a href=\"/noticias647\">ITA adequa comunicação institucional ao período de defeso eleitoral</a></h1>    \n          <h2 class=\"chamada_noticia\">Iniciativa é fundamentada na legislação eleitoral vigente</h2>    \n          <div class=\"controls-pager\"><img typeof=\"foaf:Image\" src=\"http://www.ita.br/sites/default/files/styles/noticias_controls/public/pictures/noticias/ITA-SJC%20%282%29_0.jpg?itok=TurJYG_i\" width=\"139\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" /></div>  </div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"views_slideshow_cycle_div_noticias-noticia_3\" class=\"views-slideshow-cycle-main-frame-row views_slideshow_cycle_slide views_slideshow_slide views-row-4 views_slideshow_cycle_hidden views-row-even\">\n  <div class=\"views-slideshow-cycle-main-frame-row-item views-row views-row-0 views-row-first views-row-odd\">\n    \n          <div class=\"imagem_noticia\"><a href=\"/noticias634\"><img typeof=\"foaf:Image\" src=\"http://www.ita.br/sites/default/files/styles/noticia_principal/public/pictures/noticias/ITA%20FZ.jpg?itok=MX1wdaR4\" width=\"700\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>    \n          <h1 class=\"titulo_noticia\"><a href=\"/noticias634\">ITA e CAPES firmam acordo para internacionalização do ITA-FZ</a></h1>    \n          <h2 class=\"chamada_noticia\">Parceria de dez anos prevê recursos para mobilidade acadêmica nacional e internacional</h2>    \n          <div class=\"controls-pager\"><img typeof=\"foaf:Image\" src=\"http://www.ita.br/sites/default/files/styles/noticias_controls/public/pictures/noticias/ITA%20FZ.jpg?itok=iIkTfkgZ\" width=\"139\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" /></div>  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"controls-bottom\">\n      <div class=\"buttons\">\n  <span id=\"noticias-noticia\" class=\"views-slideshow-controls-text-previous views_slideshow_controls_text_previous previous\"><a href=\"#\">Anterior</a></span>\n  <span id=\"noticias-noticia\" class=\"views-slideshow-controls-text-pause views_slideshow_controls_text_pause pause\"><a href=\"#\">Pausa</a></span>\n  <span id=\"noticias-noticia\" class=\"views-slideshow-controls-text-next views_slideshow_controls_text_next next\"><a href=\"#\">Próximo</a></span>\n</div>\n  <div id=\"views_slideshow_pager_field_item_bottom_noticias-noticia_0\" class=\"item\">\n        <img typeof=\"foaf:Image\" src=\"http://www.ita.br/sites/default/files/styles/noticias_controls/public/pictures/noticias/Biblioteca%20com%20logo.jpg?itok=l_mzfTCD\" width=\"139\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n<div id=\"views_slideshow_pager_field_item_bottom_noticias-noticia_1\" class=\"item\">\n        <img typeof=\"foaf:Image\" src=\"http://www.ita.br/sites/default/files/styles/noticias_controls/public/pictures/noticias/ITA-SJC%20%282%29_1.jpg?itok=62UF1MMd\" width=\"139\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n<div id=\"views_slideshow_pager_field_item_bottom_noticias-noticia_2\" class=\"item\">\n        <img typeof=\"foaf:Image\" src=\"http://www.ita.br/sites/default/files/styles/noticias_controls/public/pictures/noticias/ITA-SJC%20%282%29_0.jpg?itok=TurJYG_i\" width=\"139\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n<div id=\"views_slideshow_pager_field_item_bottom_noticias-noticia_3\" class=\"item\">\n        <img typeof=\"foaf:Image\" src=\"http://www.ita.br/sites/default/files/styles/noticias_controls/public/pictures/noticias/ITA%20FZ.jpg?itok=iIkTfkgZ\" width=\"139\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    \t<div id=\"clear\"></div>\n  \n  \n  \n  \n   <div id=\"clear\"></div>\n</div>  </div>\n</div>\t\t\t<div id=\"clear\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div id=\"conteudo_bg\">\n\t\t<div id=\"wrapper_conteudo\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"conteudo_auxiliar\">\n\t\t\t\t\t    <div id=\"block-views-em-destaque-block--2\" class=\"block block-views\">\n\n    <h2>Em destaque</h2>\n  \n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"destaque\">\n        \n  \n  \n          <div class=\"item item-1 first\">\n      \n  <div>        <h3 class=\"destaque_link\"><a href=\"http://www.ita.br/cpca\" target=\"_blank\">PREVENÇÃO E COMBATE AO ASSÉDIO</a></h3>  </div>  \n  <div>        <div class=\"destaque_imagem\"><img typeof=\"foaf:Image\" src=\"http://www.ita.br/sites/default/files/styles/destaque/public/pictures/destaque/CPCA.jpg?itok=9eyta-K-\" width=\"215\" height=\"75\" alt=\"\" /></div>  </div>  </div>\n  <div class=\"item item-2\">\n      \n  <div>        <h3 class=\"destaque_link\"><a href=\"https://www.vestibular.ita.br/\" target=\"_blank\">Vestibular do ITA - 2026</a></h3>  </div>  \n  <div>        <div class=\"destaque_imagem\"><img typeof=\"foaf:Image\" src=\"http://www.ita.br/sites/default/files/styles/destaque/public/pictures/destaque/Banner%20Vestibular%20do%20ITA%202027%20%282%29_0.png?itok=jitMtbRh\" width=\"215\" height=\"75\" alt=\"\" /></div>  </div>  </div>\n  <div class=\"item item-3\">\n      \n  <div>        <h3 class=\"destaque_link\"><a href=\"http://www.ita.br/concurso2025\" target=\"_blank\">Concurso ITA 2025</a></h3>  </div>  \n  <div>        <div class=\"destaque_imagem\"><img typeof=\"foaf:Image\" src=\"http://www.ita.br/sites/default/files/styles/destaque/public/pictures/destaque/02%20CONCUR%C3%87O%20.jpg?itok=ElkgkBNM\" width=\"215\" height=\"75\" alt=\"\" /></div>  </div>  </div>\n  <div class=\"item item-4\">\n      \n  <div>        <h3 class=\"destaque_link\"><a href=\"https://sjc.ifsp.edu.br/component/content/article/61-ultimas-noticias/noticias/3406-selecao-de-estudantes-de-graduacao-para-bolsas-do-programa-ciencia-na-escola\" target=\"_blank\">PROGRAMA MAIS CIÊNCIA NA ESCOLA POLO SÃO JOSÉ DOS CAMPOS/SP</a></h3>  </div>  \n  <div>        <div class=\"destaque_imagem\"><img typeof=\"foaf:Image\" src=\"http://www.ita.br/sites/default/files/styles/destaque/public/pictures/destaque/Inscri%C3%A7%C3%B5es%20Abertas%20para%20o%20Mestrado%20Profissional%20em%20Engenharia%20Aeron%C3%A1utica%20-2025_0.jpg?itok=Zh7kPmn7\" width=\"215\" height=\"75\" alt=\"\" /></div>  </div>  </div>\n  <div class=\"item item-5 last\">\n      \n  <div>        <h3 class=\"destaque_link\"><a href=\"http://www.mpaer.ita.br\" target=\"_blank\">Inscrições Abertas para o Mestrado Profissional em Engenharia Aeronáutica -2025</a></h3>  </div>  \n  <div>        <div class=\"destaque_imagem\"><img typeof=\"foaf:Image\" src=\"http://www.ita.br/sites/default/files/styles/destaque/public/pictures/destaque/Inscri%C3%A7%C3%B5es%20Abertas%20para%20o%20Mestrado%20Profissional%20em%20Engenharia%20Aeron%C3%A1utica%20-2025.jpg?itok=k3Aj26HE\" width=\"215\" height=\"75\" alt=\"\" /></div>  </div>  </div>\n  \t<div id=\"clear\"></div>\n  \n  \n  \n  \n   <div id=\"clear\"></div>\n</div>  </div>\n</div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"conteudo_principal\">\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"pagina\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  \t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    <div id=\"block-system-main--2\" class=\"block block-system\">\n\n    \n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"\">\n        \n  \n  \n  \t<div id=\"clear\"></div>\n  \n  \n  \n  \n   <div id=\"clear\"></div>\n</div>  </div>\n</div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"news_divisoes\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div id=\"clear\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div id=\"footer\">\n\t\t<div class=\"background_info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"info_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"logo\">\n\t\t\t\tInstituto Tecnológico de Aeronáutica\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"endereco\">\n          <a href=\"../localizacao\" title=\"Localizacao\">\n            <span> Praça Marechal Eduardo Gomes, 50 </span>\n            <span>Vila das Acácias, 12228-900</span>\n            <span>São José dos Campos/SP - Brasil</span>\n          </a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"apoios\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dcta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cta.br\" target=\"_blank\">Departamento de Ciência e Tecnologia Aeroespacial</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n    <div class=\"wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"menu_wrapper\">\n      \n            </div>\n    </div>\n\t</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
